WEBVTT

36:32.884 --> 36:34.385
Hmm?

36:34.510 --> 36:37.472
Too easily words of war
become acts of war.

36:37.597 --> 36:39.599
We don't know the truth yet.

36:40.183 --> 36:42.059
Lord Stark must be told of this.

36:42.185 --> 36:44.979
I don't trust a raven
to carry these words.

36:45.104 --> 36:46.981
- I'll ride to King's Landing.
- No.

36:47.106 --> 36:50.276
There must always be a Stark in Winterfell.

36:50.401 --> 36:52.195
- I will go myself.
- Mother, you can't.

36:52.320 --> 36:53.863
I must.

36:54.989 --> 36:57.575
I'll send Hal with a squad
of guardsmen to escort you.

36:57.700 --> 37:00.161
Too large a party attracts unwanted attention.
